{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43099","headline":"看蜀女转昭君变 · 吉师老","name":"看蜀女转昭君变","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妖姬未着石榴裠，自道家连锦水濆。\n檀口解知千载事，清词堪叹九秋文。\n翠眉颦处楚边月，画卷开时塞外云。\n说尽绮罗当日恨，昭君传意向文君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吉师老","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}